OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOrkney will be cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain through the day.
OL,7,FShetland will be cloudy this morning
OL,8,Fwith some rain before it becomes
OL,9,Fsomewhat drier this afternoon. Fresh
OL,10,Foccasionally strong southwesterly
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA cloudy evening and night
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain, some longer
OL,15,Fspells of rain developing in the early
OL,16,Fhours for a time. Fresh to strong
OL,17,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
