OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FStaying cloudy with further
OL,6,Fspells of rain, but Shetland may turn
OL,7,Fdrier later on. Strong southwesterly
OL,8,Fwinds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMuch
OL,11,Fdrier and brighter on Sunday with just
OL,12,Fa few showers. Dry with bright spells
OL,13,Fon Monday and Tuesday.
